 "paragraphs": [
  {
   "text": "Nothing lurks in the purity of the moon's light.",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Starfall Invocation",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pblb/34p/starfall-invocation"
  },
  {
   "text": "No battle is fought, or won, alone.",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Valley Questcaller",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pblb/36s/valley-questcaller"
  },
  {
   "text": "\"Find your mooring and stop clogging the shipping lanes!\"",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Dour Port-Mage",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pblb/47s/dour-port-mage"
  },
  {
   "text": "\"Laughing at you? No, no, I'm laughing *as* you!\"",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Mockingbird",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pblb/61p/mockingbird"
  },
  {
   "text": "Its wingspan reaches from dusk to dawn.",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Maha, Its Feathers Night",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pblb/100p/maha-its-feathers-night"
  },
  {
   "text": "We all share one life and one death. —Rotcaller saying",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Valley Rotcaller",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pblb/119p/valley-rotcaller"
  },
  {
   "text": "\"This trinket has saved my hide more times than I can count. I couldn't possibly let it go for less than say . . . four acorns.\"",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Byway Barterer",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pblb/129p/byway-barterer"
  },
  {
   "text": "\"We'll cover more ground if I split up.\"",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Stormsplitter",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pblb/154p/stormsplitter"
  },
  {
   "text": "\"Well, that's another night of research spoiled.\" —Claire, batfolk astrologer",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Valley Flamecaller",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pblb/158s/valley-flamecaller"
  },
  {
   "text": "Despite their differences, every creature and culture of Valley stood in unison against the threat.",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "For the Common Good",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pblb/172p/for-the-common-good"
  },
  {
   "text": "\"Now this one's a real collector's item. They say Lily Emberseed herself drank from this mug when she was still Lily of Valley.\"",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Keen-Eyed Curator",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pblb/181p/keen-eyed-curator"
  },
  {
   "text": "\"There is no path to the Root Maze's center. Bard, sing a song while I create one.\"",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Valley Mightcaller",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pblb/202s/valley-mightcaller"
  },
  {
   "text": "\"Why would I chase the storm? Does a cloud chase the rain? Does the sun chase the light?\"",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Alania, Divergent Storm",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pblb/204p/alania-divergent-storm"
  },
  {
   "text": "\"Your dreams are too precious to leave to chance.\"",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Dreamdew Entrancer",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pblb/211p/dreamdew-entrancer"
  },
  {
   "text": "Most of his scars tell tales. A few tell jokes.",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Hugs, Grisly Guardian",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pblb/218s/hugs-grisly-guardian"
  },
  {
   "text": "Beyond Valley lies danger—and promise.",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Fabled Passage",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pblb/252p/fabled-passage"
  }
 ]
}
